    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100324" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπ-ισχύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>join in supporting, assist</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.4.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τισι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ch.</u>
				32.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.6.10
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά τινων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.8.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς πλεονεξίαις αὐτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					28.5.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. μοι ἀπαιτοῦντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					1189.14
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">i B.C.</span><span class="entity">/i A.D.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοῖς ἀντεχομένοις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1795.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				10.1160.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἄρχοντας συνεπισχύειν τοῖς
					ἀγορανόμοις, ὅπως . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					799.19
				</span></i>
			 (Cyzicus, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1013.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Astrol.,
